{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nh8sf0j","type":"work","title":"蓬窗日錄","authors":[{"name":"陳全之","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bf29"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《蓬窗日錄》•八卷","author_info":"明陳全之撰","summary":"明陳全之撰。全之字粹仲，閩縣人。萬曆甲辰進士。是編分世務、寰宇、詩談、事紀四門，門各二卷。世務一門多可采。寰宇一門頗參輿記陳言。詩談、事紀則更傷猥雜矣。","edition":"福建巡撫采進本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《蓬窗日錄》八卷","author_info":"明陳全之撰","summary":"《蓬窗日錄》八卷。明陳全之撰。影印復旦大學圖書館藏明嘉靖四十四年刻本。","edition":"影印復旦大學圖書館藏明嘉靖四十四年刻本","volume":"第1125冊","section":"子部 雑家類"}],"juan_count":{"number":8},"resources":[{"id":"wikisource","name":"维基文库","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/蓬窗日錄","types":["text"]},{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/HY1346","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v5","total_page":998,"paragraph_count":1447,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-jiajingsishisikeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02095616","metadata":{"edition":"嘉靖四十四年刻本","version":"v2","total_page":996,"paragraph_count":10808,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02095616.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC1125%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":1125},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%93%AC%E7%AA%97%E6%97%A5%E9%8C%84%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":8}],"measure_info":"八卷","updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著錄所無者一字不書。此即 curate-dynasty S3〈借力志書〉之法——本時段有姚振宗《三國藝文志》與丁國鈞《補晉書藝文志》二部斷代志之整理本在庫，其按語備載卷數異同、佚文出處與輯家，正可為佚書之 desc 所本。**未覆核原書**。","description":{"text":"陳全之（明）撰。八卷。見著錄於《欽定四庫全書總目》《續修四庫全書》。《續修四庫全書》列於子部 雑家類。其著錄之文，《續修四庫全書》作「《蓬窗日錄》八卷」。《欽定四庫全書總目》清乾隆間館臣修；《續修四庫全書》一九九五年影印——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["欽定四庫全書總目","續修四庫全書"]},"revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","has_text":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/f/0/j/d59f2nh8sf0j-蓬窗日錄.json","_isDraft":false}